1268 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 582 0 R
/E (is group-based and least-privilege, MFA is enforced for the three department groups, and the admin user also has MFA enabled, and temporary access to the finance bucket is given through a role instead of a permanent permission. Seven tickets were handled: three lifecycle changes \(joiner, mover, leaver\), three access problems \(EC2 denied, role assumption, S3 object scope\) and one security control \(MFA and password standards\). Each was investigated to its root cause, fixed with the smallest change and verified. The access review found a control gap that no ticket had flagged: RequireMFA was missing from Developer-Group. It was re-attached.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
